Pour chaque question, rédige 3 versions:
For each question, write 3 versions of the same question, covering the same skill and worth the same points:
- "socle" (Foundational): more guided (steps, simplified data, a hint), for a struggling student;
- "standard" (Standard): the level expected of the class;
- "approfondi" (Advanced): more demanding (justification, general case, extension).
Each version has its own prompt, a detailed model answer, and grading criteria whose points add up to the question's total.
